[00:13.34]1. To Christ, by our God, Jehovah, we have been drawn
[00:24.90]To be his disciples from now on.
[00:37.24]From Jehovah’s lofty throne,
[00:42.74]How the light of truth has shone.
[00:48.74]In our hearts, our faith has grown;
[00:54.74]Our lives we vow to disown.
[00:58.14](Chorus)
[01:01.53]To God we are dedicated; This is our choice.
[01:12.57]In him and in Jesus we now rejoice.
[01:25.34]2. In prayer we have come before Jehovah to say
[01:37.53]We’ll serve him forever and obey.
[01:49.24]It’s a joy beyond compare,
[01:55.24]One that we are glad to share,
[02:01.24]As Jehovah’s name we bear,
[02:07.39]And Kingdom truth we declare.
[02:10.39](Chorus)
[02:13.39]To God we are dedicated; This is our choice.
[03:09.97]In him and in Jesus we now rejoice.